<Headline>63rd-bound Trains Bypass 43rd Station</Headline>
<ShortDescription>Ashland/63rd- and Cottage Grove-bound trains will not stop at the 43rd Green Line station.</ShortDescription>
<FullDescription>
<![CDATA[ <p><strong>How does this affect my trip?</strong><br />
Ashland/63rd- and Cottage Grove-bound trains will not stop at the 43rd Green Line station.</p>

<ul>
	<li>For 63rd-bound service from this station, take a Harlem-bound train to Indiana and transfer to a 63rd-bound train.</li>
	<li>For 63rd-bound service to this station, take a 63rd-bound train to 47th and transfer to a Harlem-bound train.</li>
</ul>

<p>Allow extra travel time.</p>

<p><strong>Why is service being changed?</strong></p>

<p>We are making improvements at the 43rd Green Line station.</p>
 ]]>
</FullDescription>
